== Abstract ==
This BIP introduces the <tt>unspendable</tt> descriptor, standardizing the
representation of unspendable Bitcoin scripts that not only prevent spending but
also commit to arbitrary data using the <tt>OP_RETURN</tt> opcode. This
descriptor enhances clarity and interoperability among Bitcoin applications
handling such outputs.

